@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Bibliographic retrieval
actor Librarian
participant "Book REST API" as API
participant BibliographicService as Service
participant GoogleBooksAdapter as Google
participant OpenLibraryAdapter as Open
participant BibliographicMerge as Merge
Librarian -> API : Request metadata by ISBN
API -> Service : retrieve(isbn)
Service -> Google : lookupByIsbn(isbn)
Google --> Service : Normalized data / outcome
Service -> Open : lookupByIsbn(isbn)
Open --> Service : Normalized data / outcome
Service -> Merge : Combine successful results
Merge --> Service : Combined metadata
Service --> API : Metadata and source outcomes
API --> Librarian : Retrieved metadata
@enduml
